<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=EUC-KR" pageEncoding="EUC-KR" %>
<%@ taglib prefix="s" uri="/struts-tags" %>
<html lang="ko"><head><title>계정 복구 · SocialMap</title></head><body><section class="sm-workspace"><header class="sm-page-heading"><h2>계정 복구</h2></header><form method="post" action="Find.action"><input type="hidden" name="find" value="pwd"><input type="hidden" name="step" value="1"><label>아이디<input type="text" name="id" value="<s:property value="resultClass.id"/>" required></label><label>이메일<input type="email" name="email" value="<s:property value="resultClass.email"/>" required></label><button type="submit">저장</button></form><h3>합성 계정 로컬 복구함</h3><p>외부 메일은 전송되지 않습니다. 토큰은 15분 동안 한 번만 사용할 수 있습니다.</p><s:iterator value="list"><p><s:property value="id"/> · <s:property value="token"/></p></s:iterator><form method="post" action="ResetPassword.action"><input type="hidden" name="step" value="1"><label>복구 토큰<input type="text" name="token" value="<s:property value="resultClass.token"/>"></label><label>새 비밀번호<input type="password" name="pwd" value="<s:property value="resultClass.pwd"/>" required></label><button type="submit">저장</button></form></section></body></html>